    <p style="text-align:justify;">The clinic is equipped with modern diagnostic and therapeutic equipment, ensuring that patients receive the most accurate diagnosis and effective treatment. The focus is on restoring normal balance and function to improve daily life, allowing patients to return to their regular activities without the limitations of vertigo.</p>

