    <p style="text-align:justify;">If you are struggling with severe knee pain, limited mobility, or advanced arthritis, consulting a reliable <strong>Knee Replacement Surgery in Maruthi Mandir</strong> is the first step toward regaining an active, pain‑free life. Knee joint conditions can severely impact daily activities such as walking, climbing stairs, sitting, or even resting comfortably. Knee replacement surgery offers a definitive solution for patients who have not responded to conservative treatments and need long‑term relief.</p>

